 worker=new Thread(delegate(){IntPtr previous=GetThreadDesktop(GetCurrentThreadId());try{Require(SetThreadDesktop(desktop),"MTA private desktop binding");Owned(window,pi,start);Capture(window,pi,start,Path.Combine(output,"before-uia.png"));AutomationElement app=Activate(window,pi,start,output);Require(app!=null&&app.Current.ProcessId==pi.pid,"UIA root identity");var tree=new List<Dictionary<string,object>>();foreach(AutomationElement n in Nodes(app)){string label=n.Current.Name;Require(label.Length<=4096,"UIA name bound");object p;var row=new Dictionary<string,object>();row["name"]=label;row["native_window_handle"]=n.Current.NativeWindowHandle;row["process_id"]=n.Current.ProcessId;row["framework_id"]=n.Current.FrameworkId;row["automation_id"]=n.Current.AutomationId;row["control_type"]=n.Current.ControlType.ProgrammaticName;row["enabled"]=n.Current.IsEnabled;row["value"]=n.TryGetCurrentPattern(ValuePattern.Pattern,out p);row["text"]=n.TryGetCurrentPattern(TextPattern.Pattern,out p);row["invoke"]=n.TryGetCurrentPattern(InvokePattern.Pattern,out p);tree.Add(row);}Save(Path.Combine(output,"uia-tree.json"),tree);AutomationElement url=Find(app,"영상 URL",ControlType.Edit);AutomationElement cookie=Find(app,"이번 작업의 Netscape 쿠키 파일 (선택)",ControlType.Edit);AutomationElement button=Find(app,"다운로드 시작",ControlType.Button);Require(Read(url)==""&&Read(cookie)=="","Startup fields must be empty");Capture(window,pi,start,Path.Combine(output,"startup.png"));bool reached=false;for(int i=0;i<150;i++){bool pending=HasLabel(app,"이전 쿠키 복사본의 종료·소유권 확인이 남아 안전하게 보존했습니다. 새 작업은 새 쿠키 선택으로 실행합니다.");bool failed=HasLabel(app,"이전 쿠키 복사본을 안전하게 확인하지 못했습니다. 앱 전용 폴더의 권한을 확인하고 다시 시도하세요.");if(mode=="error"?failed&&!button.Current.IsEnabled:button.Current.IsEnabled&&(mode=="pending"?pending:!pending)&&!failed){reached=true;break;}Pump(window,pi,start,100);}Require(reached,"Expected startup recovery state not reached");Require(Read(url)==""&&Read(cookie)=="","Startup selected credentials unexpectedly");result[